{'symbol': 'NOC', 'date': '2021-11-17 18:03:00', 'title': 'NORTHROP GRUMMAN BOARD DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': 'FALLS CHURCH, VA., NOV. 17, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF NORTHROP GRUMMAN CORPORATION (NYSE: NOC) DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $1.57 PER SHARE ON NORTHROP GRUMMAN COMMON STOCK, PAYABLE DEC. 15, 2021, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS NOV. 29, 2021.'}